PILOSCRIPT 1
name frostmere-journey
frames 450

# Enter Adventure and select Frostmere from the runtime campaign catalog.
action 0 menu-next
checkpoint 0 capture title-selection

action 1 menu-confirm
checkpoint 1 capture campaign-selection

action 2 menu-next
checkpoint 2 capture level-selection
expect 2 level frostmere

action 3 menu-confirm
expect 3 objective objective.ask-nia

# Pass beneath the root arch, follow the road west, and meet Nia at its bend.
# She points out the old ravine winch that Ceesh built into the snow shrine.
hold 4 22 forward-jump
hold 23 88 left
action 90 interact
expect 93 objective objective.turn-winch

# Close Nia's dialogue, continue west into the snow shelf, then climb to the
# winch. Turning it lowers the timber bridge.
action 94 interact
hold 95 190 left
hold 191 240 forward-jump
action 242 interact
expect 246 objective objective.reach-overlook

# Close the ember message and cross the opened bridge. The three signal stones
# sit on the natural climb in Nia's wave, forge, flame order.
action 247 interact
hold 248 273 forward-jump
action 274 interact
hold 275 286 forward-jump
action 287 interact
hold 288 298 forward-jump
action 299 interact
expect 301 objective objective.recover-lantern
action 302 interact
hold 303 319 forward-jump
hold 320 324 left
expect 326 objective objective.seek-ashfall

# Return down the same route. The open bridge must not trap the player at the
# reward shelf. The final review frame shows the recovered route without
# coupling this content journey to one exact block coordinate.
hold 329 385 backward-jump

action 422 pause
checkpoint 422 capture final
expect 422 screen paused
end
